Root cause: SvelteFlow's pane element captures drag events, preventing them from bubbling to our parent div. On WebKit/Tauri this means onDrop never fires. Fix: transparent overlay div (z-10) that appears above SvelteFlow only during drag operations. Overlay captures dragover/dragenter/drop with stopPropagation. Appears via requestAnimationFrame after dragstart (so it doesn't block the drag initiation). Removed old handlers from parent div. All sidebar draggables now have ondragend to clean up overlay on cancel.
